      "difficulty_level": "H2",
      "difficulty_reason": "The author constructs a general impredicative M-type with dependent branching and proves equality is characterized by bisimulation. The argument builds the bisimulation quotient coalgebra, lifts its dependent destructor and uses finality/eta uniqueness with the quotient computation law. It is the general coinductive-type construction, distinct from W-type induction; streams and support lemmas are not separately counted.",
